      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREYA LEGEND (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and three minors from six tries. Hit the frame latest (16.90) when third at Murray Bridge Straight in a OPEN. Looks suited and should go close. CULBURRA (8) is a sprinter who excels over the short dashes. Was too tough when scoring last time over 400m at Gawler in a Grade 5 (22.59). Is yet to taste defeat at this course and distance. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. In sparkling form with a string of wins and can measure up again. SKY KEEPING (4) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 16.39 beating Make Some Noise. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well over this trip. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Can make it two on the bounce. OUTSHINE (1) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
